  "query_preview": "/WEDNESDAY THROUGH MONDAY/...\nIssued at 1201 AM MDT Tue Aug 4 2026\n\nFrom Wednesday into the weekend, it looks very dry over the area as \nthe 500-700 mb charts are showing little if any moisture in this \nlayer through this period. If we see any precip, it will be along \nthe CO/NM border areas during this time period. Spotty critical fire \nweather conditions will be possible along the Divide. These spotty \ncritical fire weather conditions may migrate to the plains by the \nweekend. \n\nUnfortunately, temps will be gradually warming up from Wednesday \nonwards, and temps will be in the 100s once again by Friday over the \nplains. 100s are forecast from Friday through the end of this fcst \nperiod (TUE)\n\nBy Sunday into early next week, we may see some monsoon moisture \nincrease over the higher terrain. \\/Hodanish.",
